- Use standard directory structure:
  - api: API endpoint definitions
  - code: services, models, utils
  - layout: layout templates
  - page: main pages
  - js: frontend scripts
  - css: CSS files
  - view: components and pages
- Define API routes using file structure (e.g., Api/product.ts defines product endpoints)
- Import third-party libraries with link and script tags
- Use kooboo's built-in login flow
